## Repository map

| Path | What it is |
|---|---|
| `docs/adr/` | Architecture decision records: why things are the way they are |
| `CONTRIBUTING.md` | How to propose a change |
| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | CI that detects Go, Node, Python and Docker and tests what it finds |
| `.kickhub.yaml` | Records the template and parameters this repo was created from |

## Adding to this repo later

kickhub can add a component to this repository without overwriting anything:

```sh
kickhub new queue-worker -name [[.Name]] -target local -into .
```
